  "title": "20 November 1964: John Lennon films a sequence for Not Only... But Also",
  "date": "1964-11-20",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>Early in the morning <a href=\"/people/john-lennon/\">John Lennon</a> filmed part of a sequence for Dudley Moore’s forthcoming TV show Not Only… But Also. <span id=\"more-2495\"></span></p><p>Filming took place on Wimbledon Common, and was complete by mid-morning. Lennon appeared with Moore and co-star Norman Rossington, to accompany a reading of Deaf Ted, Danoota, (and me) from In His Own Write.</p><p>A second appearance was made at BBC Television Centre on <a title=\"John Lennon appears on Not Only… But Also\" href=\"/1964/11/29/john-lennon-not-only-but-also-2/\">29 November 1964</a>.</p><p>The show was broadcast on Saturday 9 January 1965 at 9.20pm on BBC Two.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1964/11/20/john-lennon-not-only-but-also/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-2495 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1964-photos/641120_lennon-not-only-but-also_01/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"200\" height=\"132\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/641120_lennon-not-only-but-also_01-200x132.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Dudley Moore, John Lennon and Norman Rossington on Not Only... But Also, 20 November 1964\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/641120_lennon-not-only-but-also_01-200x132.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/641120_lennon-not-only-but-also_01-580x383.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/641120_lennon-not-only-but-also_01-960x635.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/641120_lennon-not-only-but-also_01-768x508.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/641120_lennon-not-only-but-also_01.jpg 1000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" d